    "intro_html":  "Fajitas are already a great deal. Peppers, onions and chicken hitting a hot pan is most of the flavor for very little money. We take that and make it creamy without making it heavy, stirring a chipotle Greek yogurt sauce and a little melty mozzarella straight into the filling so every bite is smoky and soft. Each burrito comes in \u003cstrong\u003eunder 400 calories with 4 ounces of meat\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, on a high fiber tortilla that adds only about 5 grams of net carb of its own. We have a Fajita Chicken Rice Bowl on the site; this one trades the rice for refried beans and folds the peppers into a creamy chipotle wrap instead.",
